"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304522855","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110613#issuecomment-3304522855","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110613","id":3304522855,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E9wRn","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T20:49:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T20:50:08Z","body":"> Checking for `NaN` values is a bit of a complicated question, as adding this overhead everywhere is a bit expensive, but it would cover rare edge cases where figuring out what was wrong is difficult, even though the cases are all strictly user error due to incorrect usage of math functions\n\nIf we only check the values in the setters for various audio effect parameters, they'll only be checked when the value changes. This should make the cost minimal in practice.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3304522855/reactions","t